Z||000020||Reality||11-10-2001||05:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by sloth85GT:<BR><B>So let me get this right, they're one for $190 or 2 for $200?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>$190 is for the parts to come with all holes drilled NO primer N0 Screens<P>$200 all holes and primed ready to paint but still NO screens <P>I guess what I'm trying to get at is that the screens are seperate  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000021||sloth85GT||11-10-2001||06:13 PM||||What I was asking is, is it a pair for $190 or just one side for $190? How much does both sides, holes drilled, with screens installed and primed cost? What about without the primer?||||reg||1
Z||000022||Reality||11-10-2001||07:15 PM||||A set(pair) ready to paint(primed with either gray epoxy or black laquer primer, your choice) and mount without screens is $200.00 U.S.  The screens are an additional $30.00 installed.  Which makes a set ready to paint, primed with screens installed, $230.00 U.S. plus shipping.  All you have to do to this version is wipe them down with final wash(wax & grease remover) and put on your top coat.  A set with all holes cut that you prep,(finish sand and prime) is $190.00 U.S., or $220.00 with screens installed.  You can buy the screens seperate for $5.00 and come up with your own mounting system or buy the screen kit for $12.00 and use our system, but install them yourself.  Or you can order without screens and get your own which is the cheapest route.<P>  We sent a set to Canada last month I think to Fierobuzz.  The shipping was around $25.00 U.S.  He said he had to pay an additional $80.00(Can. I think) in "duty" or something when they arrived.  Don't really know the details of that situation other than the shipping charges from here were $25.00 U.S.  If someone wanted just the drivers side, cut the price in half for any version.<P>Hope this answers your question and if you have any others feel free to email or p/m either myself, Sage or Doug Kinney at the Fierowarehouse.<P>||||reg||1
